            </TextRuns>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>NB :-     If the payment  is  not paid within 15 days interest @18% P.A. will be charged. The payment should be made by  Cheque / Bank Transfer. Under customs Act 1962, any claim must be made on the customs within  SIX MONTHS from   the  date  of  payment of  duty  while  we  take every precaution in checking payments,we will not admit liability for  over charges  unless  brought to our  notice  in  time to make a claim on the Customs/Port trust/IAAI.</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
